#   sage(s)' (21, 22; 7.25); 生而知之者 'one who knew it from birth' (23; 7.19 — here 'those who know it from
#   birth'); 學如不及 'as if never catching up' frame for 如不及 (25; 8.17); 見得思義 after 14.13 見利思義
#   'seeing gain, he thinks of what is right' (24); 時然後言 'speaks only when it is time' (14.14, in Yin
#   Tun's comment at 19); 到于今 'down to now' (27; 14.18); 其斯之謂與 'Is it this that is meant?' (28; 1.15,
#   l reused); 伯夷 Boyi, 叔齊 Shuqi (27; 5.22, 7.14); 齊景公 Duke Jing of Qi (27; 12.11); 陳亢 Chen Kang =
