#   terms' (22; 10.16); 色 'beauty, women' (20; 9.17); 諒 contrasted with 14.18 / 15.36 'petty good faith' (17).
# Readings decided (Zhu Xi's marks in brackets):
#   道 dào throughout (13 ×2, 14, 15 'the Way'; 18 樂道 'to speak of', He Yan's text 噵; 26 其道); 樂 yuè 'music'
#   (13 ×2, 禮樂; 18 禮樂之樂音岳), yào 'to delight in; a delight' (18 ×8: 三樂 ×2 and each verb 樂; 樂五教反),
#   lè 'pleasure' (18 驕樂, 宴樂; 驕樂宴樂之樂音洛); 夫 fú (16 故夫三桓, demonstrative 'those'; 夫音扶), fū in the
