# Existing entries that need broadening (for the glosser):
#   桓 (Duke Huan of Lu, ancestor of the 三桓 houses — the entry has only Duke Huan of Song; Kong Anguo
#     三卿皆出桓公也);
#   諒 (in a good sense, 'sincere, true to one's word': 友諒 16.4, Zhu Xi 友諒則進於誠 — the entry has only
#     'petty good faith');
#   便 (pián 'practised, at home in, smooth': 便辟, 便佞 16.4, Zhu Xi 便平聲, 便習熟也);
#   辟 (pì in 便辟 'practised in deportment but not straight', Zhu Xi 婢亦反, 便辟謂習於威儀而不直; Ma Rong reads
