#   佞 (便佞 'practised in talk without substance', Zhu Xi 習於口語而無聞見之實);
#   樂 (yào also as a noun, 'a delight, a liking': 益者三樂 16.5);
#   節 ('the right measure', 樂節禮樂 16.5, Zhu Xi 節謂辨其制度聲容之節; He Yan 動得禮樂之節也);
#   議 ('to criticize, to find fault with (the government)', 16.2, Zhu Xi 私議, Kong Anguo 非議);
#   禄 ('the bestowing of rank and salary, as a ruler's power', 16.3; Zheng Xuan 爵禄不從君出);
#   微 ('to dwindle, to decline', 16.3, 三桓之子孫微矣; Kong Anguo 皆衰也);
#   夫 (fú as a demonstrative 'that, those', 故夫三桓 16.3, Zhu Xi 夫音扶);
#   隠 ('concealment, holding back what one should say', 16.6, Kong Anguo 隱匿不盡情實也);
#   瞽 ('blindness', of speaking without watching the face, 16.6; Zhu Xi 瞽無目不能察言觀色);
#   得 ('getting, greed for gain', 16.7, Zhu Xi and Kong Anguo 得貪得也);
#   方 ('just then, at that time', 血氣方剛 16.7);
#   上 / 下 ('the highest / the lowest (grade)', 16.9);
#   困 ('to be stuck, to meet what one cannot get through', 16.9, Zhu Xi and Kong Anguo 困謂有所不通);
#   明 ('clear-sighted, seeing clearly', 視思明 16.10, Zhu Xi 視無所蔽則明無不見);
#   難 (nàn 'trouble to follow, consequences', 忿思難 16.10, Zhu Xi 難去聲, 思難則忿必懲);
#   湯 ('hot water' is there; 探湯 'to test boiling water with the hand', 16.11);
#   異 ('something different, special', 異聞 16.13; Ma Rong 所聞當有異也);
#   逺 (verb 'to keep at a distance', 16.13, Zhu Xi 逺去聲 — the entry points to 遠);
#   寡 ('scant (in virtue), a modest word', 寡小君 16.14, Zhu Xi 寡寡徳謙辭);
